{"id":"67e5cd39557b4ecc","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Ideal Generated By Bounds","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds — ZFC Pcf2 Ideal Generated By Bounds","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds — ZFC Pcf2 Ideal Generated By Bounds","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal]]","[[../batch06/58-df-pcf]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-ideal-generated-by-bounds — ZFC Pcf2 Ideal Generated By Bounds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal\">../batch05/58-df-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf\">../batch06/58-df-pcf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (progressive set of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (regular-cardinal bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (family of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal\">../batch05/58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> (possible-cofinality operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf\">../batch06/58-df-pcf</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2IdealGeneratedByBounds}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2IdealGeneratedByBounds}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}generated\\text{-}by\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2IdealGeneratedByBounds}_S(A,\\lambda,J)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n|A|&lt;\\min A\n\\land\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}\\bigl(J,\\mathcal P(A)\\bigr)\n\\land\nJ=\n\\left\\{\nX\\subseteq A:\nX=\\varnothing\\lor\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(X)\\;(\\theta&lt;\\lambda)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}generated\\text{-}by\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2IdealGeneratedByBounds}_S(A,\\lambda,J)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nA\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n|A|&lt;\\min A\n\\land\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}\\bigl(J,\\mathcal P(A)\\bigr)\n\\land\nJ=\n\\left\\{\nX\\subseteq A:\nX=\\varnothing\\lor\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(X)\\;(\\theta&lt;\\lambda)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Excluding only <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(X)\\)</span> was too weak; membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{&lt;\\lambda}[A]\">\\(J_{&lt;\\lambda}[A]\\)</span> requires every possible cofinality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> to lie below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":